# Without this, `COPY . .` overwrites the container's restored obj/ with the host's,
# whose project.assets.json points at Windows NuGet paths. `dotnet publish
# --no-restore` then fails with NETSDK1064 "package was not found". This applies
# equally to `az acr build`, which uploads the same local context.
bin/
obj/
*.user
.vs/
